**EDGE STATE**

```javascript
// Durable Objects for real-time state
class UserSession {
  constructor(state, env) {
    this.state = state;
  }

  async onConnect(conn) {
    // Sync user state from origin
    const userData = await this.state.get('user');
    conn.send(JSON.stringify(userData));
  }

  async onMessage(message) {
    // Broadcast to other connections
    this.broadcast(message);
  }
}
```

**OPTIMIZATION**

| Technique | Benefit |
|-----------|--------|
| Connection pooling at edge | Reduce origin load |
| Message prefetching | Lower latency |
| Presence at edge | Instant status updates |
| Conflict resolution | Handle offline edits |

